  "label": "User projected onto the textual material",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the text 'a good asian driver' as the central subject of the meme's harmful stereotype. The text directly addresses the viewer by implying the user is part of the group being stereotyped or is being asked to internalize the stereotype. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you' in the text, but the meme's overall intent and framing create an implicit projection where the user is positioned as the target of the stereotype or as the one who might perpetuate or understand the meme's message.",
